<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Performance comparison of closed-source and open-source LVLMs on the three high-level tasks: Exploration, Search and Interaction.
For metrics, <math id="S4.T2.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↑</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math> / <math id="S4.T2.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math> mean ”higher is better” / ”lower is better”.</figcaption>
</figure>
